Upstream components
-------------------
WoofOS v2 is a derivative of PikaOS (https://pika-os.com, git.pika-os.com) on
Debian sid. It ships packages rebuilt from the PikaOS git repositories under
their original names and under their own licences, which are mostly GPL-3.0.
Rebranding this derivative does not remove any obligation imposed by those
licences: every package keeps its upstream copyright notices, AUTHORS file and
licence text in /usr/share/doc/<package>/. Those must be preserved when
redistributing the corresponding binaries.

PikaOS
  Copyright (C) the PikaOS project and contributors
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 (per-package; see each
  package's copyright file)

Debian
  Copyright (C) the Debian project and contributors
  Packages from the Debian archive keep their own licences and copyright files.

Image assets
------------
Only assets with an explicit free licence are redistributed. The papirus icon
theme is GPL-3.0. Artwork that is not known to permit reuse with attribution is
not redistributed; the distributor's own branding is used instead.
